1
00:00:00,273 --> 00:00:03,200
Where do patients fall out of follow-up?

2
00:00:03,559 --> 00:00:04,964
Loop starts with that question.

3
00:00:05,505 --> 00:00:08,277
Here are 5,000 fictional screening episodes.

4
00:00:08,286 --> 00:00:11,073
Among positive results with a full follow-up window,

5
00:00:11,377 --> 00:00:15,436
45% had a colonoscopy within 180 days.

6
00:00:19,091 --> 00:00:21,982
The largest gap comes after an appointment is booked.

7
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:25,091
Clicking that stage reveals individual records.

8
00:00:25,359 --> 00:00:28,055
An empty completion field tells us to investigate.

9
00:00:28,377 --> 00:00:30,727
It does not prove that someone missed their appointment.

10
00:00:39,091 --> 00:00:41,564
Now we move from analysis to action.

11
00:00:42,014 --> 00:00:44,909
This separate workspace contains 12 synthetic cases.

12
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:49,345
I find one patient, then assign a navigator to own the next step.

13
00:01:00,909 --> 00:01:03,945
Here, the source record shows a positive test,

14
00:01:04,141 --> 00:01:05,545
but no completed procedure.

15
00:01:05,977 --> 00:01:09,891
I select transport support and prepare an outreach draft for review.

16
00:01:12,727 --> 00:01:16,273
A reviewer checks patient preferences before approving the draft.

17
00:01:16,795 --> 00:01:19,036
This demonstration sends no messages.

18
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,600
Closing the case is a separate decision.

19
00:01:23,486 --> 00:01:26,055
Required tasks and evidence are still missing,

20
00:01:26,123 --> 00:01:27,673
so closure is blocked.

21
00:01:28,105 --> 00:01:30,091
A reminder is not proof of care.

22
00:01:31,818 --> 00:01:34,927
Next, I replay a synthetic referral event.

23
00:01:35,595 --> 00:01:37,368
The integration monitor shows what arrived,

24
00:01:37,377 --> 00:01:40,527
and the worklist moves from referral needed to awaiting booking.

25
00:01:42,727 --> 00:01:46,291
The same navigator stays accountable as new evidence arrives.

26
00:01:47,909 --> 00:01:50,109
The audit trail records each action.

27
00:01:50,395 --> 00:01:52,345
Every gap has a next step.
